<title>USA: Olsten Q1 net shr $0.24 vs $0.28.</title>
<headline>Olsten Q1 net shr $0.24 vs $0.28.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter				    1997	1996    %</p>
<p>(in thousands, except share amounts)</p>
<p> Revenues (a)				  $950,851 $766,043   24</p>
<p> Net income before non-recurring charge  19,167   24,625 (22)</p>
<p> Net income					19,167   21,425 (11)</p>
<p>Per share:</p>
<p>   Net income before non-recurring charge   .24	.32 (25)</p>
<p>   Net income					 .24	.28 (14)</p>
<p>   Average shares outstanding		81,362   82,076</p>
<p>Systemwide Sales (b) :</p>
<p>   Staffing Services			  650,856  488,038   33</p>
<p> Health Services				492,806  460,054    7</p>
<p> Total					  1,143,662  948,092   21</p>
<p>(a) Service sales, franchise fees, management fees and other income</p>
<p>(b) Sales generated by Company, licensed and franchised offices, and hospital-based home health agencies under management</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 includes non-recurring charge related to Quantum Health Resources, Inc.</p>
<p>The consolidated financial statements of the Company have been restated for the 1996 first quarter to reflect the 1996 acquisitions of Quantum and Co-Counsel, Inc.</p>
<p>Certain reclassifications have been made to conform Quantum's and Co Counsel's results to the Company's presentation.</p>
